    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Peel and slice potatoes and carrots, boil for 20 min with 1 L of distilled water. Mash and strain through a muslin bag. Adjust pH. Add agar. Make up to 1 L.  Autoclave to sterilize."
